Both armies stand spellbound watching the duel --- Rāvaṇa aims at Rāma's banner and misses --- Rāma fells Rāvaṇa's banner --- Rāvaṇa wounds Rāma's horses without shaking them --- Rāvaṇa rains magic weapons and thousands of arrows --- Rāma answers with hundred thousands of arrows --- Arrow floods veil the sky breathless --- Both slay each other's horses in turn
